{"pin":"BB00633","subcodes":[{"code":"BB00633","anchor":"","first_line":"O Lord, my God! O Thou the Most Lauded, the Most Holy, the Most Tender, the Most Bountiful! Remove our difficulties by Thy grace and bounty. Thou art, verily, the All-Merciful, the All-Bountiful","first_line_orig":"بسم الله البر العطوف. اللهم یا سبوح یا قدوس یا حنان یا منان فرج لنا بالفضل و الاحسان انک انت الرحمن المنان  ","language":"Ara","word_count":"20","subjects":"@prayer for tests and difficulties, @forgiveness; grace; bounty; mercy; compassion of God","translations":[{"language":"nl","lang_name":"Dutch"},{"language":"es","lang_name":"Spanish"}],"refs":[{"kind":"music","code":"Bass Adjustment","source":"Bass Adjustment","url":"https://bassadjustment.bandcamp.com/track/allahumma"},{"kind":"music","code":"L. Robinson","source":"L","locator":"Robinson","url":"https://larrirobinson.bandcamp.com/track/ala-homa"},{"kind":"music","code":"Zannetta [track 9]","source":"Zannetta [track 9]","url":"https://9starmedia.com/zannetta-sacred-synergy"},{"kind":"music","code":"unknown (1)","source":"unknown","locator":"1","url":"https://youtu.be/Iv8HPAdaM78"},{"kind":"music","code":"unknown (2)","source":"unknown","locator":"2","url":"https://youtu.be/Hg6mzN6nYJY"},{"kind":"publication","code":"NSR_1993.005","source":"NSR_1993","locator":"005","url":"https://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/c/NR1/nr1-3.html"},{"kind":"translation","code":"ADMS#056","source":"ADMS","locator":"056","url":"https://adibmasumian.com/the-bab-allahumma/"},{"kind":"translation","code":"BRL_APBH#24","source":"BRL_APBH","locator":"24","url":"https://www.bahai.org/r/575481039"},{"kind":"translation","code":"KSHK#21","source":"KSHK","locator":"21","url":"https://web.archive.org/web/20211026145946/http://www.kashkul.org/2010/12/28/allahuma/"},{"kind":"translation","code":"KSHK.BWB","source":"KSHK","locator":"BWB","url":"https://web.archive.org/web/20211026145946/http://www.kashkul.org/brief-writings-of-the-bab/"}]}]}
